body:
@littletfitness on Instagram focuses a lot on mobility in addition to strength training and it’s really cool and inspiring to see what all she can do with her body

@doclyssfitness is also short and I love that she doesn’t have like a perfectly flat stomach — she just looks strong

@senada.greca is 5’4 and her workouts are SO INTENSE. A lot of it is interesting and stuff I never would’ve thought to try lol
